alações hidráulicas e elétricas renovadas\n• 03 quartos, sendo 01 suíte\n• Lavabo\n• 03 ambientes de sala\n• Cozinha com marcenaria planejada\n• Lavanderia separada\n• Entrada social e de serviço\n• Apenas 02 apartamentos por andar\n• 02 vagas de garagem (vagão)\n• Portaria 24 horas\n• Salão de festas com churrasqueira\n\nUma excelente oportunidade para quem busca espaço, localização nobre e um imóvel pronto para morar no Batel.","fotos":["https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a1dd552736e4fb524e8fe91/pilar-homes-images-watermark/a8f14d09-335b-4b8e-88cd-d0e7a32573c9.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a1dd552736e4fb524e8fe91/pilar-homes-images-watermark/847ec172-b459-4798-a15b-3b4129f60360.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a1dd552736e4fb524e8fe91/pilar-homes-images-watermark/73fc7e36-7ba1-408e-bba9-00fb190fd158.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a1dd552736e4fb524e8fe91/pilar-homes-images-watermark/9060dee9-fbe2-4229-a0a5-39ece5898024.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a1dd552736e4fb524e8fe91/pilar-homes-images-watermark/445560f8-aed3-40b0-8b64-b265b7ec9ff5.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a1dd552736e4fb524e8fe91/pilar-homes-images-watermark/6552d187-371a-429e-b7dd-11d93abfdec2.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a1dd552736e4fb524e8fe91/pilar-homes-images-watermark/90de0a9a-9ae7-4acf-a5fe-f021eef167c5.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a1dd552736e4fb524e8fe91/pilar-homes-images-watermark/cc4199d1-88ec-4dbb-b168-921ed8b50e2d.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a1dd552736e4fb524e8fe91/pilar-homes-images-watermark/101a348a-15b0-42fa-8959-6051603c9f0e.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a1dd552736e4fb524e8fe91/pilar-homes-images-watermark/3aa4cc4c-e8c6-4f23-b6bd-792ae8cda561.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a1dd552736e4fb